Core Flasher for Flipper Zero 1.0.0

This is an independent mod of FlipTDI by SkorP / Skorpionm, distributed in
flipperdevices/flipperzero-good-faps at commit
efc32b71838d3d5e8d604c1ba7a4793916d5212f.

The FTDI/MPSSE and USB implementation contains adapted upstream source.
Original origin revision: ee70c30014bfd5b85691fb8a219ae436c84e04e8.
See third_party/flip_tdi/provenance.json for the adapted file list.

Local modifications by Moritz, September 2026: external native hardware SPI with a
saved 2/4 MHz default and MPSSE client clock selection, Core Flasher pin mapping and menu, raw byte forwarding without flash
opcode policy, complete MPSSE payload buffering, retained pending USB packets,
USB lifecycle handling, hardware JEDEC diagnostic and standalone FAP packaging.
The application runs independently.

